; Brewing atlas.
; cauldron: iron pot 64x56. cauldron_liquid_0..2: bubbling liquid overlay on the same 64x56 canvas (same anchor),
; drawn only in neutral indices 9 (body), 6 (lit edge), 7 (shade, bubble rims) and v (glints); draw it over the pot
; with `modulate` set to the potion colour. fire_0..2: 32x16 flames on logs, centred under the pot's legs.
; ladle: 12x40 stir spoon, pivot at the bowl. bottle: 20x28 glass (interior transparent) drawn OVER bottle_liquid,
; a 20x28 neutral mask of the inner volume; reveal it from the bottom to show the fill level and tint with modulate.
; fill_line: 24x3 target marker, centred on the bottle. cork: 8x7, sits on the bottle neck (x 6..13).

@ cauldron 64x56
